        {
            "type": "table",
            "anchor": null,
            "rows": [
                {
                    "row": 0,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2. The following was identified as a result of the inspection:",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": true,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 1,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.1 Remarks on the accompanying documentation (none, or give comments): 1. The quality document for the 14-piece window unit has not been provided in accordance with Subsection 5.1, 5.2, Section 15 of Technical Specification No. 1386-ARE-2025 amendment 2 dated 2025-11-23/Не предоставлен документ о качестве на оконный блок в количестве 14 штук согласно Подразделу 5.1, 5.2, Разделу 15 Технического задания No 1386-АРЕ-2025 изменение 2 от 2025-11-23.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 2,
                    "col": 0,
